# Ep.10 — Advanced SQL — Window Functions

> 📺 Watch this episode: [YouTube Link]

## 📌 What You Will Learn

- What a window function is vs GROUP BY
- OVER() — the keyword that makes it a window function
- PARTITION BY — reset the window per group
- ROW_NUMBER — always unique sequential numbers
- RANK — gaps after ties (1,2,2,4)
- DENSE_RANK — no gaps after ties (1,2,2,3)
- Top N per group pattern using ranking functions
- LAG — access the previous row's value
- LEAD — access the next row's value
- Days between orders, month-over-month growth

