## ⚠️ Common Mistakes

| Mistake | Fix |
|---|---|
| Using window function in WHERE | Use a subquery — window functions run after WHERE |
| Forgetting ORDER BY in ranking | RANK without ORDER BY gives all rows rank 1 |
| Confusing PARTITION BY with GROUP BY | PARTITION BY keeps all rows — GROUP BY collapses |
| Expecting no NULLs from LAG/LEAD | First/last rows always return NULL — use default arg |

